<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-006" chapter-id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong" source-id="s-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong">
  <p id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:allies" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:allies:m0000" ref="4c2_19b_bf4">沈充</persName>帥萬餘人來會<persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:allies:m0008" ref="mwc_md4_l0g">含</persName>等，庚辰，築壘于陵口。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:defeat" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:defeat:m0000" ref="1eg_4i2_q9u">劉遐</persName>又破<persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:defeat:m0004" ref="4c2_19b_bf4">沈充</persName>于青溪。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:subordinate" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:subordinate:m0000" ref="4c2_19b_bf4">沈充</persName>故將<persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong:subordinate:m0004" ref="3xw_c53_5if">顧颺</persName>反於武康，攻燒城邑，州縣討斬之。</p>
</text>
